# Charged ollie, Impossible (J + up) right after the pop: the flip finishes and the combo
# lands (the view's flip review: ./skate strip --sheet scenarios/tricks.strips).
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap flip+up 96
run 300
expect event trickEnd{trick=Impossible} within 120..170
expect event comboLanded{name=Impossible,points=200} within 160..240
expect no event bail
